('s0','01 · 相等的是数值','01 · Equal values'),('s1','02 · 先试所有切法','02 · Try every cut'),('s2','03 · 末尾固定长度','03 · The end fixes the length'),('s3','04 · 先预测再揭晓','04 · Predict before revealing'),('s4','05 · 对应到 Python','05 · Transfer to Python'),
('p0','这一步要回答：10101 的三段必须一样长吗？二进制数值的算法是从左到右，每读一位就把旧值乘 2，再加该位。1 的值是 1；01 是 0×2+1=1；10 是 1×2+0=2。所以 1 | 01 | 01 的三个值都是 1。','Must the three parts of 10101 have equal lengths? To read a binary value, move left to right: double the previous value, then add the next bit. The value of 1 is 1; 01 gives 0×2+1=1; 10 gives 1×2+0=2. Thus 1 | 01 | 01 has value 1 in every part.'),
