('zeros','首个 1 之前的零叫前导零，不影响数值；最后一个 1 之后的零叫尾零，每多一个就使非零数值乘 2。相等的是数值，不是段长，也不是只有 1 的数量。','Zeros before the first 1 are leading zeros and do not change the value. Zeros after the last 1 are trailing zeros; each extra one doubles a nonzero value. Equality concerns values, rather than lengths or just counts of ones.'),
('p1','这一步要回答：怎样保证不漏掉任何切法？固定 i，再让 j 从 i+2 走到 n−1。表中列出同一输入 10101 的所有 6 个合法切法。每行都重新从零计算三段的值，只有 [0,3] 成功。','How can we avoid missing a cut? Fix i, then let j range from i+2 to n−1. The table lists all 6 legal cuts of the same input 10101. Each row recomputes the three values from scratch. Only [0,3] succeeds.'),
